'''Theatre of Fear''' (キネマ怪館, ''Kinema Kai-kan'', '''Strange Cinema Hall''') is the 32nd sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 81st sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]], and is currently available up to {{4c}} difficulty. Each of its stages focuses on a different enemy trait and contains the [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].

==Difficulty==
Relatively easy compared to previous sub-chapters if you know what to expect. Since all stages have a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]], [[:Category:Cats with Curse Immunity|Curse-immune]]/[[:Category:Resist Curse Cats|resistant cats]] are recommended to have.
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Bore Jr.]]: A [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] peon with fast movement speed, a quick attack rate, high damage, and a guaranteed Lv.5 [[Mini-Wave]] on every hit.

