==Trivia==
*Each stage is named after a different horror movie:
**[[Spiralling Ring]] combines the names of ''[[wikipedia:Ring (film)|Ring]]'' and its sequel ''[[wikipedia:Spiral (1998 film)|Spiral]]''.
**[[Payday the 13th]]'s namesake is ''[[wikipedia:Friday the 13th (1980 film)|Friday the 13th]]''.
**[[Normal Activity]] is a spoof of ''[[wikipedia:Paranormal Activity|Paranormal Activity]]''.
**[[Darkened House]] is a milder version of ''[[wikipedia:Black House (film)|Black House]]''.
**[[Internal Scream]] is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Scream (1996 film)|Scream]]''.
**[[A Pile of Guts]] is the only one that doesn't make sense in English. The stage's Japanese name is Harawata no Shiryō-shitsu (はらわたの史料室, "Gut Archives"), which sounds similar to the Japanese name of ''[[wikipedia:The Evil Dead|The Evil Dead]]'': ''Shiryō no Harawata'' (死霊のはらわた, "Guts of Spirits").
***This is the second sub-chapter to have such a naming scheme; the first was [[Suburbs of the Dead]], where nearly every reference was lost in translation.
*This sub-chapter had all its stages changed in [[Version 15.3 Update|Update 15.3]], with all its stages gaining 100 length.

